---

---

<section
    id="contato"
    class="py-32 md:py-48 bg-black text-white relative overflow-hidden"
>
    <div
        class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full opacity-10 pointer-events-none"
    >
        <div
            class="absolute top-[-10%] right-[-10%] size-[800px] rounded-full bg-zinc-900 blur-[150px]"
        >
        </div>
        <div
            class="absolute bottom-[-10%] left-[-10%] size-[800px] rounded-full bg-zinc-800 blur-[150px]"
        >
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div
            class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto"
        >
            <span
                class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.6em] text-zinc-500 font-bold"
            >
                Vamos Conversar?
            </span>

            <h2
                class="text-6xl md:text-[9rem] font-black tracking-tighter leading-[0.85] uppercase"
            >
                Próximo<br />
                <span
                    class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-linear-to-r from-white to-zinc-600"
                    >Nível</span
                >.
            </h2>

            <p
                class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-zinc-400 font-medium leading-relaxed max-w-2xl px-4"
            >
                Estamos prontos para transformar sua visão em um ecossistema
                digital de elite. Agende uma conversa estratégica hoje.
            </p>

            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 mt-8 w-full sm:w-auto">
                <button
                    class="px-16 py-8 text-xl font-black uppercase tracking-widest bg-white text-black hover:scale-105 transition-transform w-full sm:w-auto text-center justify-center rounded-none"
                >
                    Agendar Consultoria
                </button>
                <button
                    class="px-16 py-8 text-xl font-black uppercase tracking-widest border-2 border-white/20 text-white hover:border-white w-full sm:w-auto text-center justify-center rounded-none"
                >
                    Ver FAQ
                </button>
            </div>

            <div
                class="flex flex-col gap-2 mt-12 text-zinc-500 font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-widest"
            >
                <span>hello@agencia.visionaria</span>
                <span>São Paulo, BR — 23° 33' S 46° 38' W</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
